      "note" : "# Genuary 3\n\nFibonacci\n\n\nUses \n\n- HRDI Environment \/ Texture for image based reflections\n- Inside of the Environment Patch\n   - Numerical Feedback with an Queue produces fibonacci sequences\n   - These are fed into various transforms to produce a queue of Transforms for Indexed Rendering\n    - Numerical Integration animates our camera ",
